# Ahoy Skill Live LLM Smoke Test Evidence
# Branch: fm/ahoy-exclusion-wording
# Commit: 9334b33d79c87bc8b4fd0ad41934a48c35d0b240
# Model: openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol via Pi 1.0.4
